<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλθάσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάσσω</span>
			, <i>soften, soothe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					381
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τωὰ λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					298
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί γάρ σε μαλθάσσοιμ᾽
			ἄν</span> . . ; why <i>should I soothe</i> thee <i>with fair
				words</i> ? <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1194
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κοιλίην</span>
			<i>relax</i> the bowels, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				40
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ μαλθάσσει λιταῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1008
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλθαχθεῖσ᾽ ὕπνῳ</span>
			<i>unnerved</i> by sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				134
			</span></i>.</div>
